type look
version 1
---
# The game's look (og-taste §12): the frame's art direction as data, named
# by GameDesc.look in src/main.ts and applied before start runs. It starts
# from the catalogue's faceted-low-poly preset (flat facets on every lit
# material, a soft vignette, AgX tone mapping); a block written below wins
# over the preset field by field, and `extends` takes any catalogue slug
# (packages/knowledge/looks/catalogue.json). `npm create @origingame/game`
# writes the game's own look from its premise, or from --look <slug>.
name "Origin Game"
extends "faceted-low-poly"
